{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/gear/injinji-toe-socks-for-rucking","version_id":"99786f8af447836523dbd0350ba00a9c3a331b5af3ba9535e9b552446b76a7d9","decision":"defer","reason":"Under Relevance, foot care for long loaded walks transfers to Mammoth, but Credibility and Unsupported claims require stronger evidence for the article's blister-prevention and comparative durability recommendations: no wear trials, distances, or documented user experiences are supplied. Commercial incentives warrant caution because the publisher earns affiliate commissions, has received GORUCK review units, and publishes a high volume of similar material.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/gear/ruck-plate-comparison","version_id":"841165b3d4db28ed76a16e7d6ca5dd9c7fa7e479f9300a63b932ad1d8eaa013c","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this comparison concerns exercise ballast and GORUCK-specific plate compatibility rather than gear that helps competitors decide what to carry at Mammoth. Commercial incentives are explicit: the affiliate publisher has received GORUCK review units and includes untested Wolf Tactical plates because that brand pays a higher commission.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/gear/ruck-plate-vs-plate-carrier-for-rucking","version_id":"cfd39a6a04a47fed6f8aafff07b1eca811ce139c6160a35295565fadd83a8345","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this is primarily a comparison of training-ballast systems and body-armor simulation, without a substantive connection to Mammoth equipment selection. Under Commercial incentives and Credibility, the affiliate publisher's GORUCK review-unit relationship also limits independence, and its comfort, heat, and bounce comparisons are not supported by testing.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/gear/smartwool-merino-base-layers","version_id":"732fe7a4c3c03ab82f431693a141954647459abaafe42d2fae31cfe843771d19","decision":"accept","reason":"Under Relevance, Credibility, and Suitability and official requirements, the attributed specifications—150 versus 250 g/m² fabric, nylon-core blend versus pure merino, and offset seams—provide citable comparisons for multi-day layering and pack contact, supporting Piece 03's questions about fit and what to test. Uncertainty and Commercial incentives require retaining the explicit absence of field testing, treating odor and durability benefits as manufacturer claims, and disclosing affiliate income and the publisher's GORUCK review-unit relationship; this item cannot independently establish the article's central argument.","piece_ids":["03"]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/guides/fall-and-winter-rucking","version_id":"d3b41d58a72158e503d71842c4d4a357f05f6102227bb484387bb34f8a5cbcf4","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this is a seasonal training, route-planning, and event-calendar guide rather than substantive evidence about competitor gear; brief suggestions about lights and layers do not establish equipment suitability or performance. Under Commercial incentives, the publisher discloses paid GORUCK event links and also has an affiliate and GORUCK review-unit relationship.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/guides/goruck-m26-preorder-analysis-new-pack-rucking-market","version_id":"becf8ba49acee9240bc51eae0bfce3d6c78ccebbcd9ca4d9d0b2f08308a4f4f1","decision":"defer","reason":"Under Relevance and Freshness and novelty, the announced pack and newly checked preorder status are potentially useful, but Credibility and Making the decision favor deferral because finished weight, loaded comfort, and load retention remain unverified and the imagery is non-final. Under Commercial incentives, the publisher earns affiliate commissions and has received GORUCK review units; the availability update alone offers insufficient evidence of Mammoth suitability.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/guides/goruck-rucker-5-0-brings-magnetic-closures-and-lumbar","version_id":"f8e236fb38c255ac5415767d19c5559bcb5a8dd099fb8ef423b1d8d15644f2ba","decision":"defer","reason":"Under Freshness and novelty, this October analysis repeats May launch specifications without newly reported testing or field experience, while Credibility and Unsupported claims leave its carrying and closure-performance conclusions insufficiently supported. Commercial incentives require noting affiliate income and GORUCK-supplied review units, and the HiConsumption and Gear Patrol launch summaries do not constitute independent testing.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/guides/goruck-spring-sweat-sale-normandy-2026-analysis","version_id":"498f53ab6c7be256c53cfdd528d53559064a94a6183795037227803ae709e93f","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance, sales, deals, and discount posts are expressly rejected: this article centers on archived markdowns and when to buy or wait, despite including product specifications and alternatives. Commercial incentives also apply because the publisher earns affiliate commissions and has received GORUCK review units.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.treelinereview.com/gearreviews/rei-co-op-magma-30-sleeping-bag-review","version_id":"4c742dc416136bc209dcfd4b570e69002f847ac2b7c81e9b48b874b0de19bfd8","decision":"accept","reason":"Under Relevance, Credibility, and Freshness and novelty, this newly reported two-year review adds over 24 backpacking nights, observations at 33–54°F, damp-weather experience, and specific bulk and durability tradeoffs for an older sleep system, supporting Pieces 01, 02, and 03. Commercial incentives and Uncertainty require disclosing affiliate commissions, attributing the single tester's findings, limiting warmth conclusions to the described conditions and clothing, and resolving inconsistent sizing and comparison weights before citing them; the review does not establish protection during repeated soaking or colder Mammoth conditions.","piece_ids":["01","02","03"]}
